### Get all tastings (with scores relation)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tastings

### Get single tasting by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tastings/1

### Get non-existent tasting (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tastings/9999

### Filter by status query parameter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tastings?status=active

### Filter by partial title match (Like operator)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tastings?title=Winter

### Create a new tasting (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tastings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ethiopian Natural vs Washed",
  "host": "Aimee",
  "dateTime": "2026-12-05T19:30",
  "capacity": 4,
  "lineup": "Worka Sakaro, Chelbesa, Sidama Bensa, Guji Uraga"
}

### Create invalid tasting - capacity out of bounds (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tastings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Too Big Cupping",
  "host": "Mo",
  "dateTime": "2026-12-10T20:00",
  "capacity": 20,
  "lineup": "Geisha"
}

### Sign up a member for a seat (Zetsel domain rule)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tastings/1/signups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberName": "Daan"
}